audience: Technical leads and maintainers
purpose: Why does the SessionStart hook count only the review backlog?

Records that the SessionStart hook counts only documents without a review receipt, does not run engsys, and drops its timeout from 20 to 5 seconds, superseding the SessionStart part of ADR 0009.
Translated from Korean to English; frontmatter, the measurement table values (5.1 s, 2.2 s, 7.2 s, 77 documents), 0.145 s and 0.16 s figures and the design 0002 link are unchanged.
Table headers and the "초" unit rendered in English ("s"/"seconds"); no numbers changed.
Headings mapped to Decision, Background and Constraints, Rationale and Alternatives, Consequences; the em-dash aside in the last bullet became a parenthetical.
No Korean literals retained.

